@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-40 - View Inventory Overview

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Inventory UI" as FE
control "InventoryController" as API
control "InventoryService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoesDetail, stockMovements" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-40
FE -> API: GET /inventory/overview
API -> Service: Execute View Inventory Overview
Service -> DB: Read/write shoesDetail, stockMovements
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Hiển thị bảng tồn kho

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Lọc theo low-stock only
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Hiển thị bảng tồn kho
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/inventory
2. System gọi API GET /inventory
3. System trả về danh sách products với stock tổng
4. Highlight: low stock (<=5), out of stock (=0)
end note
@enduml
